        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá waawutmo kitaábuudá' Baruku aa /ayma'aá Yeremí'ií gooín da/ato nguwa hhe'eés, axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yeremia gana malé axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kitaábuú hatlá' taataahheek, axweesantadá' taa gooín baraá kitaábuuduú geera, kudá' Yehoyakimu waawutmoó Yuda a daá/ ar asla, gooimeek malé ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee daanduú waawutmo Yehoyakimu waawutmoó Yudawo ta o', anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a kah, kuúng kitaábuudá' una dá/, a didií kat, ahaá waáy gár kángw waawutmoó Babuloni ngusa gooín, iwa kaahi, ‹Yaamuuká' gi hhitín, muu nee makaywo giri hhaamiis.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ daanduú Yehoyakimu waawutmoó múk Yudawo, a kah, ‹Baraá xwaylarose heé iwiít baraá kitángw waawuti'iima oo Daudi i kaahh, nee tuuaarós kan kwaahh tsee/amá gari láy tlaatla/aango nee xweeraawo daqtamo gari diif. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng inós un muúx nee xwaylarose dinkwa nee sagadiyuuserós asma tlakweemaaín. Inooín in amotlakweérií huúw nee yaamuloousér Yerusalemu sleémeero nee múk Yuda sleémeero daanduú tidá' aáng nga bawí nee inooín tari axaasiiká.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
